{"capturado_en": "2026-11-11T23:43:14+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tower of Babel: Survivors of Chaos", "steam_appid": 2665680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4742150, 4171170], "detailed_description": "<h1>Thank You for 200,000 Copies Sold</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665680/extras/57418ac38bcca0afad8bc09f6e97d3bd.avif?t=1794293199\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665680/extras_big/57418ac38bcca0afad8bc09f6e97d3bd.avif?t=1794293199 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’re very grateful to share that <strong>Tower of Babel: Survivors of Chaos has surpassed 200,000 copies sold.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our journey began at Steam Next Fest in February 2025, where the game ranked among the event’s 50 most-played demos. After launching in Early Access that May, it reached 100,000 copies sold in approximately one month and was later included among Steam’s top releases of May 2025.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since then, we’ve continued improving and expanding the game with help from your feedback, leading up to the full release and its additional characters, stages, challenges, and endgame content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We sincerely appreciate everyone who has played the game, written a review, shared feedback, created videos or streams, or recommended it to others. Every form of support has helped us reach more players and make the game better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reaching 200,000 copies means a great deal to our team, and we know we could not have reached this point without all of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’ll continue improving the PC version while preparing <strong>console versions of Tower of Babel: Survivors of Chaos</strong> and exploring new projects set in the Tower of Babel universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thank you for being part of this journey and for supporting Tower of Babel: Survivors of Chaos.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tower of Babel Team</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665680/extras/cec34bb902843e48c6acce9eadc1acae.poster.avif?t=1794293199\" width=600 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665680/extras/cec34bb902843e48c6acce9eadc1acae.webm?t=1794293199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665680/extras/cec34bb902843e48c6acce9eadc1acae.mp4?t=1794293199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Will you climb the tower, no matter the cost, to get everything you desire?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blending <strong>Vampire Survivors'</strong> and <strong>Diablo's</strong> hack-and-slash action, roguelite survivor elements, and loot-based mechanics, <strong>Tower of Babel</strong> is a single-player action-RPG experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665680/extras/08dcb021fd3f27c88d0e2ff6ad5df384.poster.avif?t=1794293199\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665680/extras/08dcb021fd3f27c88d0e2ff6ad5df384.webm?t=1794293199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665680/extras/08dcb021fd3f27c88d0e2ff6ad5df384.mp4?t=1794293199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADE WITH WEAPONS AND EQUIPMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle relentless waves of enemies, acquire new skills, and upgrade your abilities. Become stronger with new gear and weapons. With a unique character build and numerous item combinations, your goal is to ascend to the top level. Join forces with heroes who have gathered for their own missions, defeat the swarming monsters, and reach the top of the <strong>Tower of Babel</strong>.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665680/extras/7d0ed53c0dce8730c1c32506dba3f1c1.avif?t=1794293199\" width=600 height=336 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ASCEND AGAINST ALL ODDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though its origins are shrouded in mystery, legend says that those who reach the top can obtain everything they desire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters infest every floor, and you have limited weapons and gear at your disposal with language barriers surrounding you. Despite these obstacles, your sole aim is to reach the summit, pushing yourself to acquire items and grow stronger. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What awaits you at the pinnacle of the <strong>Tower of Babel</strong>? Will your journey conclude with happiness? Discover the truth for yourself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665680/extras/0d399bf5a50f3cefbbd0c41eaa6f21a9.poster.avif?t=1794293199\" width=600 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665680/extras/0d399bf5a50f3cefbbd0c41eaa6f21a9.webm?t=1794293199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665680/extras/0d399bf5a50f3cefbbd0c41eaa6f21a9.mp4?t=1794293199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COLLECT, EQUIP, AND PREVAIL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of the game, hordes of monsters converge to claim your life. Defeat them and earn experience to unlock new skills and upgrade your abilities. Craft a unique build using various combinations to overpower the monsters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect items dropped after defeating enemies. For rare items, slay more monsters and ascend to higher floors. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665680/extras/9f001e7cd1d42b5a55359fb98ab14e1b.poster.avif?t=1794293199\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665680/extras/9f001e7cd1d42b5a55359fb98ab14e1b.webm?t=1794293199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665680/extras/9f001e7cd1d42b5a55359fb98ab14e1b.mp4?t=1794293199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the looted gear to the lobby to inspect, equip, and upgrade. With high-grade items and random abilities, infinite growth is achievable. Equipping new weapons and armor will also alter your character’s appearance. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gorgeous Hand-Drawn 2D Dark Fantasy Graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense Survival Combat Action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own style with various skills and abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot Hundreds of Items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare unique items with random options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources and upgrade</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665680/extras/cec34bb902843e48c6acce9eadc1acae.poster.avif?t=1794293199\" width=600 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665680/extras/cec34bb902843e48c6acce9eadc1acae.webm?t=1794293199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665680/extras/cec34bb902843e48c6acce9eadc1acae.mp4?t=1794293199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Will you climb the tower, no matter the cost, to get everything you desire?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blending <strong>Vampire Survivors'</strong> and <strong>Diablo's</strong> hack-and-slash action, roguelite survivor elements, and loot-based mechanics, <strong>Tower of Babel</strong> is a single-player action-RPG experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665680/extras/08dcb021fd3f27c88d0e2ff6ad5df384.poster.avif?t=1794293199\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665680/extras/08dcb021fd3f27c88d0e2ff6ad5df384.webm?t=1794293199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665680/extras/08dcb021fd3f27c88d0e2ff6ad5df384.mp4?t=1794293199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADE WITH WEAPONS AND EQUIPMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle relentless waves of enemies, acquire